# `now()` and `ago()` use the injected clock (D-015); `now(offset)` adds the offset.
mode: run
now: 2024-03-15T10:30:00Z
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
| project n = now(), plus = now(1h), a = ago(1d), recent = timestamp > ago(365d)
---- expected
n                    | plus                 | a                    | recent
datetime             | datetime             | datetime             | bool
---------------------+----------------------+----------------------+-------
2024-03-15T10:30:00Z | 2024-03-15T11:30:00Z | 2024-03-14T10:30:00Z | true
